{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/e3891eb646144180939bd95a94ee4634/snapshots/8ba3c95233934c1bbbd923fb91e30654-00004.jpg\"/><p>隨著晝夜溫差擴大，中國新疆維吾爾自治區伊犁河上，一座橋樑周圍的水域和森林，被一層壯觀的晨霧所籠罩。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8508323_新疆伊犁河晨霧籠罩 金光穿霧如油畫 俯瞰神州 - 截图1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/e3891eb646144180939bd95a94ee4634/snapshots/8ba3c95233934c1bbbd923fb91e30654-00001.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>穿透薄霧，黎明的第一道曙光化作溫暖的金色光束，傾瀉在寬闊的河面和兩岸綿延的次生林上。這一景象宛如一幅明亮、輕輕呼吸的油畫。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T00:52:06.618674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:17.259287+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T00:45:32.527809+00:00","content_hash":"690980290a42f676b083e739221374bdf592aa3216c186e5e6d21d67af7a9762","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T00:52:06.618674+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}